<title>USA: Wheelabrator sees 1997 EPS $1.20 to $1.25.</title>
<headline>Wheelabrator sees 1997 EPS $1.20 to $1.25.</headline>
<dateline>HAMPTON, N.H. 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wheelabrator Technologies Inc said Tuesday it expects to earn $1.20-$1.25 per share in 1997. It earned $0.65 a share from continuing operations in 1996.</p>
<p>The company said that in light of anticipated increased cash flow, it has boosted its share repurchase program to 30 million shares from 10 million.</p>
<p>It said it expects to initiate a $350 million Dutch auction tender offer. It said it will announce the tender offer price range late in the first quarter.  </p>
<p>It said it expects to generate about $220 million of cash flow from continuing operations this year.</p>
<p>Company officials were not avaliable for comment.</p>
</text>
